    "text": "<p>Increase in length&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/bitsat/eae578bf-3df1-4616-948e-757cca5971f6-image.png\" style=\"width: 330px; height: 115px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mi>D</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi></math></p><p>or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi></math>&nbsp;[<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo></math> using Bionomial theorem]</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>&#8776;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>